<view class="page login-page"><view class="login-brand">知<view></view></view><view class="login-eyebrow">WELCOME TO ZHIKE</view><view class="login-title">欢迎来到知课</view><view class="login-copy">每一份热爱，都值得认真学习</view>
<view class="login-panel card"><view class="login-tabs"><view class="{{mode === 'wechat' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="wechat" bindtap="changeMode">微信登录</view><view wx:if="{{config.smsConfigured || config.demoMode}}" class="{{mode === 'phone' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="phone" bindtap="changeMode">手机号登录</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{mode === 'wechat'}}" class="wechat-panel"><view class="wechat-mark"><view></view><view></view><text>● ●</text></view><view class="wechat-title">微信认证，轻松开启学习</view><view class="wechat-copy"><view>通过微信安全获取身份凭证</view><view>首次登录自动创建账号，无需短信验证</view></view><button class="wechat-button" bindtap="wechatLogin" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">微信认证登录</button><view class="capability-hint" wx:if="{{config && !config.wechatConfigured}}">微信认证暂不可用，请稍后重试或联系老师。</view></view>
<view wx:else class="phone-panel"><view class="field-label">手机号</view><view class="input-wrap"><text>+86</text><input type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入手机号" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="inputPhone"/></view><view class="field-label">短信验证码</view><view class="input-wrap"><input type="number" maxlength="6" placeholder="请输入 6 位验证码" value="{{code}}" bindinput="inputCode"/><button bindtap="sendCode" disabled="{{sending || countdown > 0}}">{{countdown > 0 ? countdown + '秒后重发' : sending ? '发送中' : '获取验证码'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{demoCode}}" class="notice">演示验证码：{{demoCode}}，当前未发送真实短信。</view><button class="primary phone-submit" bindtap="phoneLogin" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">登录 / 注册</button><view class="capability-hint">首次登录将自动创建知课账号</view></view>
<view class="login-error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="consent" bindtap="toggleAgreement"><view class="checkbox {{agreed ? 'checked' : ''}}">{{agreed ? '✓' : ''}}</view><text>同意微信身份用于登录及课程服务</text></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{config.demoMode}}" class="demo-panel"><view class="demo-divider"><view></view><text>功能演示</text><view></view></view><button class="ghost" bindtap="demoLogin" disabled="{{busy}}">演示登录</button><view class="capability-hint">仅体验课程流程，不进行真实授权或交易</view></view><view class="login-footer">知课 ZHIKE · 陪伴每一次进步</view></view>

<contact-dialog visible="{{showContact}}" user="{{contactUser}}" bind:saved="finishContact" bind:close="finishContact"/>
